=2 Walkthrough
\**{c=red:Notice:}** Wait one game day and re-zone after completing {q:Fire in the Hole|Fire in the Hole|Fire in the Hole} before starting this quest.
* Zone into {z:Bastok Markets (S)} from {z:North Gustaberg (S)} for a cutscene.
** You must have received an {i:Elixir|Elixir|4145} from {n:Blatherix} after completing {q:Burden of Suspicion|Burden of Suspicion|Burden of Suspicion} in order to trigger this event.
* Speak to {p:Gentle Tiger|Gentle Tiger (S)} in {z:Bastok Markets (S)} (H-6) for a cutscene.
* Visit the following townfolk in any order:
** {n:Paul} at (H-5).
** {p:Biggorf} at (H-10).
** {n:Wilhelmina} at (I-9).
* Return to {p:Gentle Tiger|Gentle Tiger (S)} for a cutscene.
* Speak to {n:Blatherix} at (F-8) for a cutscene.
** If you don't get the cutscene, talk to to {n:Paul}, {p:Biggorf}, and {n:Wilhelmina} more until they talk about "Darksteel Hurricane".
* Trade {n:Blatherix} a {i:Goblin Mess Tin|Goblin Mess Tin|2542}, {i:Goblin Mushpot|Goblin Mushpot|4543}, and {i:Twinkle Powder|Twinkle Powder|1241} for another cutscene.
** {i:Goblin Mess Tins|Goblin Mess Tin|2542} drop from {m:Goblin Skirmishers|Goblin Skirmisher} and other goblins (more on {p:https://www.ffxidb.com/items/2542}) . (buy from {z:Auction House}, Other -> Beast-made).
*** Notice: {m:Goblin Skirmisher} have very few (3-4) spawn points in their areas.
** {i:Goblin Mushpots|Goblin Mushpot|4543} can be bought from {n:Pawkrix} in {z:Lower Jeuno} (H-10).
** {i:Twinkle Powder|Twinkle Powder|1241} can be bought from {n:Upih Khachla} in {z:Windurst Waters} (north map) (H-9).
*** Occasionally {n:Dabih Jajalioh} in {z:Ru'Lude Gardens} (F-9) will have {i:Twinkle Powder|Twinkle Powder|1241} in stock.
* Return to {p:Gentle Tiger|Gentle Tiger (S)} again for another cutscene.
* Examine the **???** at {z:Vunkerl Inlet (S)} (F-6) for a cutscene.
** Located just east of the bridge
** {p:Survival Guide} in {z:Vunkerl Inlet (S)}, or {p:Atmacite Refiner} are quickest ways.
* Return to {n:Blatherix} to receive your reward.

